{"id":"594ebea503d1a5bb","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-internal-induction.md","title":"内部归纳","display":"df-internal-induction — 内部归纳","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-internal-induction","aliases":["91-df-internal-induction"],"display":"df-internal-induction — 内部归纳","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-induction]]","[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-quantifier-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-internal-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-internal-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-induction — 内部归纳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"580e312553b05c39\" href=\"?note=580e312553b05c39\" title=\"91-df-quantifier-axiom\">91-df-quantifier-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-internal-induction-—-内部归纳-$\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}$\">df-internal-induction — 内部归纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\">\\(\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为自由变元的公式集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(a,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(a,n)\\)</span> (捕获规避地代入数字后的编码函数,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{Int}}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&amp;\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},0))\n\\land\n\\forall n\\,\n\\left[\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\to\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n+1))\n\\right]\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\n\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{Int}}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&amp;\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},0))\n\\land\n\\forall n\\,\n\\left[\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\to\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n+1))\n\\right]\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\n\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\">\\(\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}\\)</span> : 内部归纳规则</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\\)</span> : 用数字\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 代入后句子的 Gödel 编码</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：内部归纳把基例、归纳步和结论都置于真理谓词内部。使用\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\\)</span> 是必要的：对象语言中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 接受的是句子编码，\n而不是元语言公式或自由变元本身。</p>\n<p>与算术归纳的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>算术归纳</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(0) \\land \\forall n\\;(\\varphi(n) \\to \\varphi(n+1)) \\to \\forall x\\, \\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(0) \\land \\forall n\\;(\\varphi(n) \\to \\varphi(n+1)) \\to \\forall x\\, \\varphi(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>内部归纳</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 包装每个数字实例，结论也是关于全称句编码的\n真理断言。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>它既不同于扩展语言上的外部归纳模式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，也不同于仅从所有实例真推出全称句真的\n量词真理公理。具体真理理论是否包含哪一种归纳，必须由该理论的公理化\n单独说明，不能从“KF”“FS”之名自动推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-internal-induction-—-内部归纳-$\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}$","text":"df-internal-induction — 内部归纳 $\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Int}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 ·